,"predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}{R}{R}","name":"Volcanic Fallout","oracle_id":"bd6ce147-c991-40ac-b276-65b630fad8b6","oracle_text":"This spell can't be countered.\nVolcanic Fallout deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2020-11-20","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"As the triggered ability resolves, the active player gets the option to perform the action. If that player declines, the next player in turn order gets the option. As soon as any player performs the action, the spell is countered, but the remaining players still get the option. If all players decline, the spell remains on the stack.","oracle_id":"13da5255-2fc5-43a4-a44c-13a5d9ff77c3","published_at":"2007-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When this spell is cast, its “when you cast” ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it.","oracle_id":"13da5255-2fc5-43a4-a44c-13a5d9ff77c3","published_at":"2007-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"As the triggered ability resolves, the active player gets the option to perform the action. If that player declines, the next player in turn order gets the option. As soon as any player performs the action, the spell is countered, but the remaining players still get the option. If all players decline, the spell remains on the stack.","oracle_id":"6a4ace6b-ef3a-4d11-89d7-958f98dcc445","published_at":"2007-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When this spell is cast, its “when you cast” ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it.","oracle_id":"6a4ace6b-ef3a-4d11-89d7-958f98dcc445","published_at":"2007-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"A player can’t choose to pay 5 life unless they actually have 5 or more life to pay.","oracle_id":"6a4ace6b-ef3a-4d11-89d7-958f98dcc445","published_at":"2013-07-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Volcanic Fallout can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Countersquall). Those spells will still resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Volcanic Fallout won't do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.","oracle_id":"bd6ce147-c991-40ac-b276-65b630fad8b6","published_at":"2009-02-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
